{
  "id": "breast_er_her2neg",
  "name": "ER+/HER2- breast cancer",
  "description": "Research model of ER-positive, HER2-negative breast cancer evolving under endocrine suppression, CDK4/6 inhibition and SERD switching. Clones: ER-sensitive (ESR1 wild type), the ESR1 Y537S and D538G ligand-independent mutants, and an aggregate CDK4/6-escape phenotype (RB1 loss / CCNE1-high). Parameters are cell-model calibration values with explicit evidence levels, not clinical constants.",
